1
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:55,719
Who are you? How dare you hug me?

2
00:02:55,720 --> 00:03:00,160
We promised we'd wait for one another.
Don't you remember?

3
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,319
<i>If he doesn't fear death,</i>

4
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,079
<i>then let him die as he wishes.</i>

5
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,959
I won't let you escape again.

6
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,160
We'll see.

7
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,680
What's happening?

8
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,040
Men has left the tent.

9
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,920
Then let's hurry and save Kaimook.

10
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,880
Dad and I will go first.

11
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,160
Be careful, Sarai.

12
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,640
Let's go.

13
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,079
Mook, my girl.

14
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,760
Dad.

15
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,920
Run now!

16
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,640
Stand down.

17
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,999
I said stand down!

18
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,320
We don't take orders from you anymore.

19
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,240
That's right.

20
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,439
You traitor!

21
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:56,039
Everyone, kill him.

22
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:58,400
Sarai, be careful.

23
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,960
Go help Kaimook.

24
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:14,320
- It's me.
- Mr. Narathon.

25
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,000
Don't be afraid. I'm here to save you.

26
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:23,560
Thon, move!

27
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,360
I thought you'd already left Skull Island.

28
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,920
I'll never leave without you.

29
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,760
Are you alright, Kaimook?

30
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,039
Mook.

31
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,560
Dad.

32
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,439
Are you alright?

33
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,200
I'm fine, Dad.

34
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,159
Da. Na.

35
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,160
Mook.

36
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:40,520
I thought I'd never see you again.

37
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:50,760
Mr. Narathon saved me.
He nearly died protecting me.

38
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,960
I told him to leave, but he refused.

39
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:59,280
Thank you for not abandoning my daughter.

40
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:08,720
You have to get out of here.
They've only retreated.

41
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,680
They'll be back any moment.

42
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,720
Can't we kill them?

43
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,280
We're bound by a spell.

44
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:22,720
We can't be killed unless Men dies.

45
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,080
Only then will they finally be set free.

46
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,039
What are we going to do?

47
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,840
They won't let us leave that easily.

48
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:39,038
I think we should split up.

49
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:41,640
If we all stay together,
none of us may make it.

50
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,799
I agree.

51
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,320
They'll have to split up to chase us.

52
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:50,960
I'll be easier to deal with them.

53
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,320
As long as you reach the boat,

54
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,600
you'll be safe.

55
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:02,960
These spirits cannot leave the island.

56
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,880
Then we'll split into three groups.

57
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,160
Mook, come with me.

58
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:22,120
You can go with Mr. Narathon.

59
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,760
Please take care of my daughter.

60
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,320
Yes.

61
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,879
Then Mr. Mek, Dara, and Mana go together.

62
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,319
I'll go with Mr. Son and Sarai.

63
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,760
We'll meet at the boat.

64
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,880
Let's go.

65
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:40,519
Thon, keep this with you.

66
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:43,400
The Buddha's blessing will protect you
until you reach the boat safely.

67
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,399
What about you, Dad?

68
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,800
Don't worry. Let's meet at the boat.

69
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,359
Good luck, everyone.

70
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,400
Let's go.

71
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,640
You tricked me out here
so they can rescue Kaimook, right?

72
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:34,519
Good. Then I'll kill you

73
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:38,080
and bind your spirit
under my deck forever.

74
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,080
You can't escape me.

75
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,880
What's happening?

76
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,240
Maybe someone's come to save us.

77
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,040
Who's going to save us?

78
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,560
When we were alive,

79
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:09,120
we only hurt other people.

80
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,160
I think

81
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,040
that ghost Men

82
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,800
is binding our spirits

83
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:23,360
to this Ghost Ship forever.

84
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,560
No. I won't accept that.

85
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,320
We need to find a way out.

86
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,960
Let's go.

87
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:42,400
Why aren't you helping me?

88
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,680
There's no way out.

89
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,080
Right now,

90
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:55,080
I've accepted the fate
I brought upon myself.

91
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,920
You should accept yours too.

92
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,240
I won't.

93
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,480
I'll get out of here no matter what.

94
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,440
Help me!

95
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,960
Help me! Anyone, help me!

96
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:18,199
Help me! Help me!

97
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,399
Anyone.

98
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:21,279
Please help me.

99
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,640
Help me!

100
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,440
Be careful.

101
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,120
Don't be scared, Kaimook.

102
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,000
Dad, be careful.

103
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,600
Na, help me!

104
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:08,919
- Dad!
- Dad!

105
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,519
Na, help me.

106
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,800
- Help me.
- Hold my hand, Dad.

107
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,240
Dad!

108
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,040
Na.

109
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:31,960
Dad! Come up now!

110
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,680
Dad.

111
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,480
The Buddha's blessing
really can protect us from these ghosts.

112
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:56,360
Let's go.

113
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:08,760
They are spirits.

114
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:10,560
They're not real venomous creatures.

115
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:12,720
They're trying to scare us.

116
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,120
Stay away! Stay away!

117
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,360
They're gone.

118
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:41,519
Come on, Dad.

119
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,119
- Dad.
- Come up.

120
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,439
Come on.

121
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,879
Come up.

122
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:46,880
Come on.

123
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,320
Dad.

124
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:56,520
Are you okay, Dad?

125
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:59,640
I'm okay.

126
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:03,800
The boat's over there.

127
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:05,760
Let's hurry.

128
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,440
- Come on, Dad.
- Hurry up.

129
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,639
Da, stay here with Dad.

130
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:30,399
I'll go check on the others.

131
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,560
Alright?

132
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:33,159
Be careful.

133
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,240
- Alright.
- Da.

134
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,119
Go with Na.

135
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,680
I can stay here alone.

136
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,120
Please help Mook.

137
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:44,360
Yes, Dad. Let's go, Da.

138
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,360
That's Dara and Mana.

139
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,839
Dad's waiting on the boat. Let's hurry.

140
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,320
What about Thon and Kaimook?

141
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,880
I haven't seen them.

142
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:32,560
- Let's wait on the boat.
- Wait.

143
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,480
What is it, Dad?

144
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:38,520
They're coming.

145
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,080
Take everyone to the boat, Sarai.

146
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,239
I'll hold them off.

147
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,680
I want you to come with us.

148
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:48,720
I can't go.

149
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,880
My spirit is also bound by the spell.

150
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:54,400
I can't leave this island anyway.

151
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,760
Just go.

152
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,040
Let's go.

153
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,160
Da, watch out.

154
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,160
Mr. Phum.

155
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:17,760
You...

156
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,000
Stop!

157
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:42,480
Why are we fighting each other?

158
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:47,240
You and I are in the same situation.

159
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:52,720
Have you forgotten
how long we've suffered?

160
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:57,440
Everyone who came here
is trying to free us.

161
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,720
Really?

162
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,560
Why would I lie to you?

163
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,439
Right now, Men is fighting
a magic user on the Ghost Ship.

164
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,720
You all know that.

165
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:15,000
Leave now.

166
00:20:16,120 --> 00:20:17,280
Soon,

167
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,480
all of us will be set free.

168
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:23,640
But if that person fails,

169
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:26,000
we'll be punished even worse.

170
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,720
If that happens,

171
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,360
I'll take full responsibility.

172
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:47,200
I'll rip your heart out, Thongdee.

173
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,560
Nam Phi iron dagger?

174
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:18,480
Yes. Nam Phi iron,
capable of breaking every curse,

175
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:20,880
even the invulnerability

176
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:23,600
of someone like you.

177
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:29,120
You...

178
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:32,840
I never intended to use it
to destroy anyone's magic.

179
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:34,880
But because

180
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:38,040
you keep creating endless bad karma,

181
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:40,120
I have no choice.

182
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:43,600
Forgive me, Men.

183
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,320
Men.

184
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:02,840
Mr. Thongdee must have struck that ghost.

185
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:48,520
The Nam Phi iron
can destroy your magic too, Thongdee.

186
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:51,800
Your time to die has come, Thongdee.

187
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:30,360
Help me.

188
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,160
Help me!

189
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:37,239
Can anyone hear me?

190
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,480
Help me.

191
00:24:39,360 --> 00:24:40,480
Help me.

192
00:24:43,520 --> 00:24:45,600
Can anyone hear me?

193
00:24:48,280 --> 00:24:49,440
Help me.

194
00:24:54,360 --> 00:24:55,640
Damn it.

195
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:09,120
Pong, come here.

196
00:25:10,320 --> 00:25:11,400
What now?

197
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,160
I found a way out.

198
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:31,840
How is that possible?

199
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:34,480
Maybe luck is on our side.

200
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:37,880
But,

201
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,800
Men sealed it with a spell.

202
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:43,400
Why would it suddenly open?

203
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:47,120
Who cares how it happened?
Right now, we need to run.

204
00:25:49,360 --> 00:25:50,200
Let's go.

205
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:04,800
Look.

206
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:11,920
Whose blood is that?

207
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:39,720
It must be a magical dagger.

208
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:44,360
Could it be that Men was attacked?

209
00:27:32,600 --> 00:27:34,800
Why hasn't Mr. Thongdee come back by now?

210
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:38,040
That's right.

211
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:42,200
If he managed to deal with Men,
he should have returned to us already.

212
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,600
What's that?

213
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:57,080
Those fireballs are spirits.

214
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:02,000
The spirits of the crew
have been released.

215
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,080
Sarai,

216
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:07,320
I can leave the island now.

217
00:28:11,280 --> 00:28:12,360
Then,

218
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:14,360
Men must be dead, right?

219
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:47,240
Why are you coming back here?
I thought we were running away.

220
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:51,680
I think this is Men's blood.

221
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:53,520
The sounds we heard

222
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:56,280
must have been someone attacking him.

223
00:28:57,760 --> 00:29:00,800
His spell was broken,
so we were able to escape.

224
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:03,240
That means he must be badly injured,

225
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,960
or maybe even dead.

226
00:29:07,320 --> 00:29:08,440
If that's true, that's even better.

227
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:11,239
This is our chance
to get away from Skull Island.

228
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:13,960
If he's no longer on this island,
why would we run?

229
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:17,560
We have nowhere to go, Pong.

230
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:00,560
Where did he go?

231
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:35,360
Did you think I would die that easily?

232
00:30:36,040 --> 00:30:38,079
Even wounded by the Nam Phi iron dagger,

233
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:40,600
I can still kill the two of you with ease.

234
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:44,280
Don't hurt us.

235
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:47,280
I...

236
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,440
I'll serve you as your servant.

237
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,840
What did you say?

238
00:30:56,320 --> 00:30:58,520
I thought it over.

239
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,080
I don't want to be a wandering ghost.

240
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:04,399
I'd rather serve
a powerful spirit skilled in magic

241
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:06,280
like you.

242
00:31:07,840 --> 00:31:08,760
Are you sure?

243
00:31:09,280 --> 00:31:10,520
I am.

244
00:31:16,560 --> 00:31:17,600
Good.

245
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:20,840
Then I have an important task for you.

246
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:22,840
Okay.

247
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:25,680
The two of us will get it done.

248
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,280
What is it, Dad?

249
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,240
Men isn't dead.

250
00:31:41,080 --> 00:31:42,480
Then what about Mr. Thongdee?

251
00:31:45,040 --> 00:31:46,000
I don't know.

252
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:49,280
But Men is calling for me.

253
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:53,680
His voice and the power reaching me
are very weak.

254
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:56,960
Sarai,

255
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:59,200
take everyone off the island first.

256
00:32:01,080 --> 00:32:02,040
No.

257
00:32:02,800 --> 00:32:03,680
No.

258
00:32:04,360 --> 00:32:05,360
What about you?

259
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:07,400
I'm going to check on Men.

260
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,559
Don't go, Dad.

261
00:32:09,560 --> 00:32:11,360
He won't let you out.

262
00:32:13,120 --> 00:32:14,760
I owe him.

263
00:32:16,760 --> 00:32:18,279
No.

264
00:32:18,280 --> 00:32:19,719
Don't go back.

265
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:22,920
He'll make you his servant again.

266
00:32:24,280 --> 00:32:25,640
I have to go.

267
00:32:32,480 --> 00:32:33,440
Dad!

268
00:32:38,120 --> 00:32:39,880
Your father is too good-hearted.

269
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,920
He won't abandon someone
who once saved his life.

270
00:32:45,760 --> 00:32:47,200
We have to let him go.

271
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:49,880
No.

272
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,400
Son.

273
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:12,760
Men.

274
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:17,480
I knew you wouldn't abandon me.

275
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:21,520
Why have you become like this?

276
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:29,120
Thongdee used a Nam Phi iron dagger
to destroy my magic.

277
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:32,519
But because it missed my heart,

278
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:35,640
only half of my power was destroyed.

279
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:39,519
Where is Thongdee now?

280
00:33:39,520 --> 00:33:41,120
He's dead.

281
00:33:45,520 --> 00:33:47,480
Alright, Son.

282
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:52,600
I must perform a ritual to heal this wound
and restore my magic.

283
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:55,200
Before sunrise,

284
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:59,240
no one can be allowed to ruin the ritual.

285
00:34:00,160 --> 00:34:03,880
Guard the ship well.
Do not let anyone invade this place.

286
00:34:12,120 --> 00:34:15,080
What? Aren't you going to help me?

287
00:34:20,040 --> 00:34:21,679
I'm willing to help you,

288
00:34:23,080 --> 00:34:25,120
but can I ask you for one thing?

289
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:28,040
Speak.

290
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:33,320
Please let everyone go.

291
00:34:34,719 --> 00:34:36,280
I don't want you to hurt anyone anymore.

292
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:44,840
Fine.

293
00:34:45,679 --> 00:34:46,840
I promise.

294
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:51,520
Once my body is healed

295
00:34:52,239 --> 00:34:55,040
and my magic restored,

296
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:59,400
I won't want anything else.

297
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:03,640
Thank you.

298
00:35:04,160 --> 00:35:05,040
Then,

299
00:35:05,560 --> 00:35:08,200
I'll go guard the ship.
I won't let anyone come aboard.

300
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:24,200
Traitor.

301
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:36,320
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

302
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:40,440
I may be a spirit now,

303
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:43,880
but I won't let anyone
order me around so easily.

304
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,560
The moment I get the chance,

305
00:35:47,080 --> 00:35:48,800
I won't let him get away with it.

306
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:52,920
Since we can't kill him ourselves,

307
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:56,920
we'll have someone else do it for us.

308
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,600
Do as your father said.

309
00:36:07,640 --> 00:36:08,960
We have to leave the island now.

310
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:15,800
Let's go.

311
00:36:18,120 --> 00:36:18,960
Sairung.

312
00:36:20,560 --> 00:36:21,680
Mr. Phum.

313
00:36:33,120 --> 00:36:34,160
You're dead?

314
00:36:43,160 --> 00:36:44,240
Why are you here?

315
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:52,440
It was all my fault.

316
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:56,200
I wanted the treasure on Skull Island.

317
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:00,440
But Pong's boat

318
00:37:01,560 --> 00:37:03,000
was caught in a storm,

319
00:37:04,160 --> 00:37:06,840
and we fell into the sea.

320
00:37:10,720 --> 00:37:12,680
Before I died,

321
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:15,200
I finally understood

322
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:17,480
how much you suffered,

323
00:37:18,040 --> 00:37:19,600
trapped beneath the sea.

324
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,400
Sarai,

325
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:28,120
I realize it now.

326
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:31,320
I realized

327
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:35,120
how unforgivable what I did to you was.

328
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:40,320
Because I was greedy

329
00:37:41,080 --> 00:37:43,640
for the gold hidden on Skull Island,

330
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,640
so,

331
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:50,800
I ordered Pong,

332
00:37:52,240 --> 00:37:53,560
Sompong,

333
00:37:54,520 --> 00:37:56,680
and Thongdee to kidnap you

334
00:37:58,280 --> 00:38:00,120
so you'd lead us here.

335
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:03,120
But they accidentally killed you...

336
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:10,320
and trapped your spirit.

337
00:38:12,600 --> 00:38:14,080
I'm sorry.

338
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:17,120
I'm really sorry.

339
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:20,640
Can you forgive me?

340
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:24,600
I have to apologize too.

341
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:28,960
Thongdee?

342
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:30,640
Which Thongdee?

343
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:34,440
Thongdee...

344
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:38,880
the former Venerable monk everyone knew.

345
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:41,520
I only found out myself not long ago.

346
00:38:45,720 --> 00:38:47,520
No wonder he looked so familiar.

347
00:38:49,480 --> 00:38:51,320
He was the man I saw in that video.

348
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:59,240
But now,
everyone has paid for what they did.

349
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,520
What do you mean?

350
00:39:05,240 --> 00:39:07,160
Men killed Thongdee.

351
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:16,280
As for Men,

352
00:39:17,080 --> 00:39:20,480
he's badly injured
from the magic dagger.

353
00:39:22,720 --> 00:39:23,680
The Nam Phi iron dagger.

354
00:39:29,560 --> 00:39:31,200
So he ordered us

355
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:33,680
to capture all of you,

356
00:39:34,800 --> 00:39:36,400
especially Kaimook.

357
00:39:42,120 --> 00:39:44,440
That damned ghost just won't give up.

358
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:49,080
There's only one way.

359
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,800
You have to kill him.

360
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:54,120
We've tried everything.

361
00:39:55,240 --> 00:39:57,720
Even Thongdee,
with all his magic, couldn't defeat him.

362
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,600
Use Thongdee's Nam Phi iron dagger.

363
00:40:01,480 --> 00:40:03,200
Its power can definitely kill him.

364
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:05,360
Where is the dagger now?

365
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:09,000
On Men's Ghost Ship.

366
00:40:10,360 --> 00:40:14,520
Everyone,
let's go find the Nam Phi iron dagger.

367
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:18,959
Dad.

368
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:22,159
Sarai, I told you

369
00:40:22,160 --> 00:40:24,439
to take everyone off this island.

370
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:26,199
Why won't you listen?

371
00:40:26,200 --> 00:40:27,680
We have to kill Men.

372
00:40:28,720 --> 00:40:30,040
Don't let this cycle
of vengeance continue.

373
00:40:30,640 --> 00:40:34,160
Men promised me he'd let all of you go.

374
00:40:35,240 --> 00:40:36,480
You all

375
00:40:37,520 --> 00:40:39,200
should let him go as well.

376
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:42,440
He's deceiving you, Dad.

377
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:45,160
He ordered Sairung and Pong to capture us.

378
00:40:46,440 --> 00:40:47,280
What?

379
00:40:48,600 --> 00:40:49,800
It's true.

380
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:52,679
He ordered Pong and me to capture everyone

381
00:40:52,680 --> 00:40:55,399
and hold them
until he finishes restoring his magic

382
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:58,200
and healing his wounds.

383
00:40:59,080 --> 00:41:00,920
Then he'll kill everyone.

384
00:41:04,200 --> 00:41:05,320
Men...

385
00:41:07,040 --> 00:41:08,360
Were you lying to me?

386
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:12,560
Dad, we don't have much time.

387
00:41:13,080 --> 00:41:14,800
We have to find the Nam Phi iron dagger

388
00:41:15,400 --> 00:41:16,720
and kill him.

389
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:38,440
Guard the entrance to the room
where Men is performing the ritual.

390
00:41:39,200 --> 00:41:41,680
If he makes any move,
signal us immediately.

391
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:48,440
Sarai, be careful.

392
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:58,480
Let's find the Nam Phi iron dagger.

393
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:00,280
Be careful, everyone.

394
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:15,080
Let's start our plan.

395
00:42:28,200 --> 00:42:29,320
Did you find it, Na?

396
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:32,680
I don't see anything.

397
00:42:39,120 --> 00:42:40,720
There's blood everywhere.

398
00:42:52,720 --> 00:42:54,200
What room is this?

399
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:57,680
Looks like the storage room.

400
00:42:58,680 --> 00:43:01,520
The Nam Phi iron dagger
probably isn't in here.

401
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:06,199
But Ms. Sairung said Mr. Thongdee and Men

402
00:43:06,200 --> 00:43:07,840
fought all over the ship.

403
00:43:08,520 --> 00:43:10,880
I think we should keep looking.

404
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:15,960
Na, there's another room here.

405
00:43:29,680 --> 00:43:30,719
- Da.
- Na.

406
00:43:30,720 --> 00:43:32,920
The door's locked from the outside.

407
00:43:34,200 --> 00:43:35,280
What do you mean?

408
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:37,400
Did someone lock us in here?

409
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:42,200
- What do we do? We can't get out.
- I don't know.

410
00:43:44,240 --> 00:43:48,120
That's right, you fools.
It's already too late.

411
00:43:53,120 --> 00:43:54,760
Son betrayed you. He's going to kill you.

412
00:43:58,480 --> 00:43:59,479
No!

413
00:43:59,480 --> 00:44:01,959
Have I ever told you

414
00:44:01,960 --> 00:44:03,479
that I love you?

415
00:44:03,480 --> 00:44:04,400
You damn ghost!

416
00:44:10,120 --> 00:44:11,400
Go, Kaimook!

417
00:44:48,320 --> 00:44:50,560
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
